{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/18add0b3c2fdb5bab5ed3cb553e8afa9.poster.avif?t=1768116963\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/18add0b3c2fdb5bab5ed3cb553e8afa9.webm?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/18add0b3c2fdb5bab5ed3cb553e8afa9.mp4?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're living the dream. You're a cat running your own hotdog shop! Serve your fellow animal residents of Pawston and become a master sauce-slinger in <strong>Animal Style!</strong>\u00a0Manage your shop and fulfill orders for your hungry (or sometimes <i>hangry</i>) animal customers as you learn the art of Sauce Balancing. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep your balance...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/e9fe8badbd06f8ef3df4159500dadbb8.poster.avif?t=1768116963\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/e9fe8badbd06f8ef3df4159500dadbb8.webm?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/e9fe8badbd06f8ef3df4159500dadbb8.mp4?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using <strong>realistic fluid physics</strong>, sauce anything you can imagine, and some things you can't. Balance a variety of objects while adding the required sauces, and try not to let the sauce fall off! Discover and sauce all 60 unique objects, it's not as easy as it sounds! In addition to Sauce Balancing, a variety of other physics challenges await you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the regulars, and sauce 'em up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/3a0822426b70244adcbfd85fc3eaf9d5.poster.avif?t=1768116963\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/3a0822426b70244adcbfd85fc3eaf9d5.webm?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/3a0822426b70244adcbfd85fc3eaf9d5.mp4?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of Pawston come in all different species, shapes and sizes! Some are serious, some are goofy, and some are downright unhinged. Listen to their tales, contemplate life, and serve them the sauce they need to get through the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the city from a dry, sauce-less future...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/8de7804e93a4839c3ffbb5aa2a961109.poster.avif?t=1768116963\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/8de7804e93a4839c3ffbb5aa2a961109.webm?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/8de7804e93a4839c3ffbb5aa2a961109.mp4?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil hivemind is invading the dreams of you and all the residents of Pawston! Can you harness all the sauces to defeat the invaders and save everyone from a dry, sauce-less future? Use the patent-pending Sauce Soaker to repel evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to upgrade your sauce bottles and kegs. Progress though the perk board to unlock all the sauces, as well as some fun extras! Decorate the shop. Print memes. Play the xylophone. Use the arcade machine to re-sauce any object you have encountered. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797260?t=1768116963","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/1959fdb628fbb3b3db20ca525148ae4db86a5c23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768116963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/46eec893af41adbffd81849a2247bbbd275645a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768116963","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/46eec893af41adbffd81849a2247bbbd275645a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768116963","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4152540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/18add0b3c2fdb5bab5ed3cb553e8afa9.poster.avif?t=1768116963\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/18add0b3c2fdb5bab5ed3cb553e8afa9.webm?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/18add0b3c2fdb5bab5ed3cb553e8afa9.mp4?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're living the dream. You're a cat running your own hotdog shop! Serve your fellow animal residents of Pawston and become a master sauce-slinger in <strong>Animal Style!</strong>\u00a0Manage your shop and fulfill orders for your hungry (or sometimes <i>hangry</i>) animal customers as you learn the art of Sauce Balancing. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep your balance...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/e9fe8badbd06f8ef3df4159500dadbb8.poster.avif?t=1768116963\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/e9fe8badbd06f8ef3df4159500dadbb8.webm?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/e9fe8badbd06f8ef3df4159500dadbb8.mp4?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using <strong>realistic fluid physics</strong>, sauce anything you can imagine, and some things you can't. Balance a variety of objects while adding the required sauces, and try not to let the sauce fall off! Discover and sauce all 60 unique objects, it's not as easy as it sounds! In addition to Sauce Balancing, a variety of other physics challenges await you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the regulars, and sauce 'em up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/3a0822426b70244adcbfd85fc3eaf9d5.poster.avif?t=1768116963\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/3a0822426b70244adcbfd85fc3eaf9d5.webm?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/3a0822426b70244adcbfd85fc3eaf9d5.mp4?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of Pawston come in all different species, shapes and sizes! Some are serious, some are goofy, and some are downright unhinged. Listen to their tales, contemplate life, and serve them the sauce they need to get through the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the city from a dry, sauce-less future...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/8de7804e93a4839c3ffbb5aa2a961109.poster.avif?t=1768116963\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/8de7804e93a4839c3ffbb5aa2a961109.webm?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/8de7804e93a4839c3ffbb5aa2a961109.mp4?t=1768116963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil hivemind is invading the dreams of you and all the residents of Pawston! Can you harness all the sauces to defeat the invaders and save everyone from a dry, sauce-less future? Use the patent-pending Sauce Soaker to repel evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to upgrade your sauce bottles and kegs. Progress though the perk board to unlock all the sauces, as well as some fun extras! Decorate the shop. Print memes. Play the xylophone. Use the arcade machine to re-sauce any object you have encountered. </p>","developers":["SaucerGamesLLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/0d16f497586ba31684b6dc8562c71741f9b1fef1/header.jpg?t=1768116963","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor